// ------------------------------------------------------------
// **Data sources**
//
// - Power generation, renewable share, cross-border flows: [Energy-Charts.info](https://energy-charts.info) (Fraunhofer ISE) · [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
// - Electricity prices (day-ahead, DE-LU): [Bundesnetzagentur | SMARD.de](https://www.smard.de) · [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), retrieved via the Energy-Charts API
//
// *Changes: values aggregated, grouped and converted (e.g. EUR/MWh → ct/kWh). Updated every 5 minutes (prices every 15 minutes) · All times in German local time*
